description	"Dark Trooper Phase III
 
A Jetpack-equipped tank with a high-powered Assault Cannon, Rocket Launcher, and Shoulder-mounted Missile Launchers.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Assault Cannon (Bowcaster 3)
-- 5% faster RoF
-- 10% more damage
- Assault Cannon Rocket Attachment (12) (RL)
-- Pushes on hit
-- 25% more velocity
-- 25% slower RoF
-- 60% slower reload
- Shoulder Missile Launchers (Tradcaster 2)
-- 80% more damage
-- Explodes on hit
-- 91% less velocity
-- 100% slower mag reload

^8Attributes:
- 10% more knockback given
- 10% less knockback taken
- Strength (2)
- Elemental Resist (1)
- Beskar (3)
- Blast Armor
- Melee Resist
- Base Damage Taken 

^3Abilities:
- Jetpack

The Phase III Dark Trooper was the last and most powerful dark trooper exoskeleton / droid. Although equal in height to the Phase II dark trooper, it was far stronger and more durable. This culminated into the fact it was intended to be the armor of the next generation of stormtroopers. It was sometimes even classified as a bipedal tank."